WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.850
New alerts every day. Which ones really matter?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.450
Deepin Security turns your logs into evidence.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.250
Alerts arrive as stories, not noise, with what matters most on top.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.844
An employee has left the company, but the account is still active.

5
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.934
We place them next to colleagues who do the same work.

6
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.900
Only they reached the payment systems no one else touches.

7
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:33.210
They tried the management networks too, and were blocked.

8
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.481
Behind every finding, the raw log is right there.

9
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.786
Ask a question, and the answer comes from the records.

10
00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.451
When the logs can't tell, it says so, honestly.

11
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:53.567
Findings map to attack techniques, and their stages.

12
00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:02.189
People, networks, alerts and sources, all on one screen.

13
00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.997
And your data never leaves your organization.

14
00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:12.024
Deepin Security. From alert to evidence.
